{"product_id":"drop-x","title":"Drop X","description":"\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur latest outdoor spa model, the Drop X, offers a luxurious bathing experience second to none. With room for up to eight people, massage seats for five, and a total of 46 massaging water nozzles, this state-of-the-art spa pool represents the absolute elite among our minimalist Drop Design Pools. It comes with all the amenities, including a control panel and an ozonization system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShaped like a drop, our Drop Design Pools are inspired by Finland’s beautiful nature, and their minimalistic design was created by Finnish designer Nikolai Ruola. Drop outdoor spas integrate seamlessly into any outdoor space, and they can be embedded in a terrace for an even more discreet look. These electrically heated outdoor spas are both designed and manufactured in Finland.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThere are few things more enjoyable than letting yourself sink into steaming hot water that nurtures your mind and body, taking a few deep breaths, and giving your body a break from the demands of your hectic life. Right there, just outside your beautiful home, surrounded by your loved ones and feeling perfectly well, relaxed and present at the moment.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv hidden=\"\" class=\"accordion tablinks active\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eTECHNICAL DETAILS\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"teknisettiedot\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"solu129501\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e Technical details\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePeople capacity: 6–8; massage seats for 6\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide length: *220 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInner diameter: *195 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight: *105,0 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eImmersion dept: *97 cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater capacity: 1830 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWater use: 1000-1500 L\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMaterial: Acrylic\/ reinforced plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight: approx. 300 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectric connection: 3 x 16 A, 400V \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+\/- 0,5cm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eContents of the pool package\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDrop spa pool in white, grey or black\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAluminum frame\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 kW electrical heating (6kW in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassaging nozzle system\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e46 rotating massaging nozzles, massage seats for six\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMassage pump 2.2 kW\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilter system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED pool light\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eDigital control panel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003e30 mm polyurethane insulation of the entire frame (50 mm in Finland, Sweden, and Norway)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eInsulation cover\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUV system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOzonisation system\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-stringify-indent=\"0\"\u003eStarter kit of pool chemicals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"sisalto\" class=\"tab panel cpadding-s\"\u003e\n\u003carticle class=\"col-full\"\u003e\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/article\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553768010052,"sku":"301110508","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794827076,"sku":"301110509","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553768042820,"sku":"301110208","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794892612,"sku":"301110209","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Temperate","offer_id":44553768075588,"sku":"301110408","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794925380,"sku":"301110409","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Temperate","offer_id":47716794958148,"sku":"301110558","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Matte Black \/ Cold","offer_id":47716794990916,"sku":"301110559","price":21200.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/products\/image_50e6f7ed-60f6-49db-af61-b3835aeb1107.jpg?v=1677687072","url":"https:\/\/heatica.com\/en-at\/products\/drop-x","provider":"Heatica","version":"1.0","type":"link"}